Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.29,0:00:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.46,0:00:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You....
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.55,0:00:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You selling?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.34,0:00:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know\Nwhat you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.30,0:00:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. That's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.02,0:00:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just saying, you know,\Nif you were selling...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.36,0:00:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,...l could maybe do with a teenth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.65,0:00:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You' re kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.32,0:00:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, I so smell bacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.87,0:00:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.37,0:00:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, gee, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.25,0:00:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,How about over there.\NThat brown van.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.29,0:01:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's yours, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.67,0:01:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What brown van?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.84,0:01:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Parked all inconspicuous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.17,0:01:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a cop van.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.84,0:01:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, another one right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.34,0:01:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,"Duke City Flowers"? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.18,0:01:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you at least be original?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.43,0:01:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, I just wanna get high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.06,0:01:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,A flower van.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.90,0:01:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what you should do\Nis a garbage truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.82,0:01:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously,\Nand l don' t mean to disrespect...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.99,0:01:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,...but if you put cops\Nin the back of a garbage truck...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.78,0:01:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,...there's no way\NI'm seriously thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.07,0:01:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...that there's cops\Nin the back of a garbage truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.87,0:01:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a freebie, yo. Just think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.41,0:01:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.67,0:01:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. l'm hitting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.67,0:01:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You dudes give up that easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.51,0:01:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.09,0:01:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Then lift your shirt.\NShow me you're not wearing a wire.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.47,0:01:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.14,0:02:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to show you\Nyou' re being an asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.14,0:02:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm blinded by white.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.44,0:02:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Douchebag.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.65,0:02:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. l was joking. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.36,0:02:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't walk away angry.\NSit down. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.53,0:02:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean,\Nwhat are you complaining about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.45,0:02:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You got abs, man. Kind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.91,0:02:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.99,0:02:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not even sure\NI wanna buy anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.91,0:02:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you turned me off\Nto the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.79,0:02:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Don't be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.04,0:02:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need you to prove it,\Nyou know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.46,0:02:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Prove you're not a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.17,0:02:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell\Nam l supposed to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.76,0:02:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.64,0:02:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I got it. Go over there\Nand punch that dude right in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.22,0:02:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Which dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.19,0:02:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-That dude?\N-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.65,0:02:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No way. He'd kick my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.07,0:02:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,True that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.90,0:02:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so hard, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.03,0:02:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.83,0:03:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.95,0:03:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If you ask a cop if he's a cop,\Nhe's, like, obligated to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.50,0:03:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in the Constitution.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.58,0:03:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Constitution of America?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.96,0:03:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So go ahead and ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.88,0:03:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-You a cop?\N-No, no. Not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.39,0:03:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask it, like, official.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.72,0:03:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a police officer?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.85,0:03:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I am not a police officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.60,0:03:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then. Hundred\Nand seventy-five for a teenth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.69,0:03:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The price is the price, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.11,0:03:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.35,0:04:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go. Enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.06,0:04:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.90,0:04:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Albuquerque Police! You' re\Nunder arrest! Get down on the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.07,0:04:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Get on your stomach now!\NOn your stomach. Get on the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.62,0:04:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hold it right there. Don't move.\N-Stay down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.89,0:04:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a good job\Nuntil my boss accused me of stealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.98,0:04:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,l better call Saul.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.11,0:05:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I was out partying,\Nminding my own business....
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.91,0:05:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-You are under arrest.\N-l better call Saul.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.33,0:05:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi. I' m Saul Goodman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.62,0:05:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know that you have rights?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.54,0:05:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The Constitution says you do.\NAnd so do l.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.21,0:05:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that until proven guilty...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.38,0:05:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,...every man, woman,\Nand child in this country is innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.76,0:05:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's why l fight for you,\NAlbuquerque.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.93,0:05:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Better call Saul.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.14,0:05:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Saul Goodman, attorney at law,\N505-1 64-CALL.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.43,0:05:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That' s 505-1 64-CALL.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.14,0:05:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I really need to get some furniture.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.15,0:05:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I suggest you start with a bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.03,0:05:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,God, I wish we could smoke in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.78,0:05:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, you can't.\N-Yeah, no. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.33,0:05:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.75,0:05:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think I can't smell that weed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.79,0:05:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You better seriously hope\Nthat airs out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.88,0:05:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,My dad will keep\Nyour security deposit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.84,0:06:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a nose\Nlike a damn bloodhound.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.34,0:06:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.18,0:06:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Has he ever caught you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.35,0:06:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.44,0:06:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.86,0:06:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I already lost my deposit\Nand all...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.36,0:06:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,...maybe we should light up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.87,0:06:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.74,0:06:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.29,0:06:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, is it cool if l burn one?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.92,0:06:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you'll change your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.51,0:06:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Do what you wanna do, l guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.51,0:06:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. What'd l say?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.35,0:06:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.06,0:06:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have to go is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.75,0:07:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.09,0:07:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My 1 8-month chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.38,0:07:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.59,0:07:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And, you know,\Npot is like stepping stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.60,0:07:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Recovery? That's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.98,0:07:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Right on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.11,0:07:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I respect that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.90,0:07:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,\NI don't really burn much anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.94,0:07:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a sometime thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.03,0:07:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But no more, like, in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.62,0:07:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So you wanna go grab\Nsome dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.08,0:08:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I could really go for some Chinese.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.79,0:08:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I better hit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.01,0:08:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We....
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.01,0:08:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.14,0:08:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Your satellite is on, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.27,0:08:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That screen is badass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.70,0:08:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I just think it's asking a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.00,0:08:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.21,0:08:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's done nothing but apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.46,0:08:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this gonna be\Nevery weekend now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.21,0:08:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No. It's just the end of the quarter.\NYou remember how that was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.71,0:08:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But l am earning double time,\Nso there's a bright side.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.51,0:08:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So when the laziest boy\Nin the world wakes up...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.10,0:08:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,...tell him he better wash\Nthose sneakers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.27,0:08:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And l said bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.47,0:08:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And tell him\Nto let them air-dry this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.02,0:09:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want him\Nbanging the hell out of my dryer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.61,0:09:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.23,0:09:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you don't even get\Ncasual Saturday?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.65,0:09:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean....
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.95,0:09:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it' s just you....
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.82,0:09:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You look nice is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.95,0:09:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's work, Walt.\NAnd everybody is gonna be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.33,0:09:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-Okay.\N-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.54,0:09:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we'll order a pizza tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.21,0:09:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.33,0:09:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-Bye.\N-Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.76,0:09:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi. You've reached Walt,\NSkyler and Walter, Jr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.02,0:09:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Please leave a message,\Nand we'll get back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.56,0:09:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Skyler? Are you there?\NI don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.27,0:09:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I.... I need to talk to you. I....
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.07,0:09:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Marie. It's me. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.29,0:10:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yesterday I got home\Nand found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.63,0:10:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn' t even tell me\Nhe was coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.63,0:10:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-A man was killed?\N-A Federale, right in front of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.97,0:10:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Three agents wounded,\None lost his leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.55,0:10:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like what you hear about\Nfrom lraq or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.39,0:10:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-The lEDs.\N-Oh, Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.39,0:10:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to hear about it\Nfrom Steve Gomez.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.44,0:10:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hank talked to his ASAC\Nfor about an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.07,0:10:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hank could win an Oscar.\NHe's so damn breezy with the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.53,0:10:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He hangs up the phone,\Ngoes right back to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.78,0:10:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And all he keeps saying is,\N"I' m fine. l'm fine. Leave me alone."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.77,0:11:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby, not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.73,0:11:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's-- It's me, Hank. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.49,0:11:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy. What' s...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.66,0:11:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.58,0:11:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I just....
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.58,0:11:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mind if l....
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.08,0:11:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So....
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.13,0:11:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.84,0:11:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you know, lousy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.09,0:11:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Montezuma's revenge, big time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.80,0:11:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, everything's going through me\Nlike crap through a tinhorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.39,0:11:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Better not get too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.31,0:11:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, l'll take my chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.62,0:12:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you heard about\Nwhat happened down in Juárez?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.00,0:12:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.58,0:12:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you expect?\NBunch of freaking animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.21,0:12:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like Apocalypse Now\Ndown there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.04,0:12:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like Colonel Kurtz\Nholed up in his jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.59,0:12:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And my SAC in El Paso\Nsends me home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.89,0:12:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, that' s a sound leadership\Ndecision right there, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.81,0:12:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, you don't put\Nyour second most senior man...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.10,0:12:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,...on the trail\Nof those motherless bastards...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.40,0:12:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...you send him home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.40,0:12:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I was, you know,\N"He's out getting an evidence bag...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.24,0:12:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,...and so ends up\Nwithout a scratch on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.36,0:12:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So must be something wrong\Nwith that picture, you know."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.41,0:12:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So are you home for good then?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.79,0:12:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no. It's....
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Playing it by ear. To be determined.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.51,0:13:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Think you might wanna talk it through\Nwith somebody?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.51,0:13:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What, a shrink?\NNo, no, no. Can't go down that road.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.76,0:13:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Start going down that road,\Nkiss your career goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.39,0:13:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Or Marie. Or me, if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.61,0:13:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I don't know\Nhow to say this. I....
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.74,0:13:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, the things l deal with...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.04,0:13:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,...you and me don't have\Nmuch of a--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.50,0:13:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What you might call\N"an experiential overlap."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.81,0:13:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I told you we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.73,0:14:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I have spent my whole life scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.24,0:14:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Frightened of things\Nthat could happen...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.58,0:14:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,...might happen, might not happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.12,0:14:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifty years I spent like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.42,0:14:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Finding myself awake\Nat 3 in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.59,0:14:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.38,0:14:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since my diagnosis...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.51,0:14:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,...l sleep just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.36,0:14:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.57,0:14:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And l came to realize\Nit' s that fear that' s the worst of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.07,0:14:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the real enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.03,0:14:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So....
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.83,0:14:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.71,0:14:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.63,0:15:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And you kick that bastard\Nas hard as you can right in the teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.35,0:15:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it again. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.45,0:15:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten thousand even, same as last time.\NIt's totally accurate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.95,0:15:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I,\Nwe are gonna feed this machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.20,0:15:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-l want it running 24 hours a day.\N-Right on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.26,0:15:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yours, I take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.80,0:15:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We got 1 0, 20, 30...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.18,0:15:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,...44, five each.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.15,0:16:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Three pounds should be 48 each.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.73,0:16:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's short?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.99,0:16:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Don' t freak, all right?\NWe didn't get ripped off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.95,0:16:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But Badger hasn' t kicked in\Nhis full amount.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.12,0:16:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he was planning on pulling\Nan all-nighter...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.62,0:16:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,...so he's probably still in the sack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.54,0:16:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Then wake him up.\NHe can sleep after we're paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.62,0:16:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why you gotta be such a hard-on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.29,0:16:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You' re not his pal. You're his boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.00,0:16:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This only works when\Nthey' re scared of you, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.55,0:16:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Jack off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.14,0:16:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going straight to voicemail.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.06,0:16:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Voicemail?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.52,0:16:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just chill, okay? Count your money.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.11,0:16:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-Combo.\N-Yo, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.57,0:16:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You seen Badger?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.82,0:16:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you cover for him, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.91,0:16:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I ask you a straight-up question,\NI expect a straight-up answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.72,0:17:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.18,0:17:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,They were too scared to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.02,0:17:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Badger got busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.86,0:17:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.10,0:18:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey, I' m home!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.65,0:18:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Too slow! What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.07,0:18:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Got more lives than a damn cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.07,0:18:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now if l could only learn\Nto lick myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.07,0:18:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, guys? Good to see you.\NGood to see you. Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.58,0:18:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Let's all get back to work,\Nfor chrissake, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.58,0:18:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,In my office, man. Let's see\Nwhat you bozos been up to lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.31,0:18:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.61,0:18:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanging in?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.32,0:18:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.82,0:18:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-What's this from A.P.D.?\N-Been checking with them to see...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.78,0:18:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,...if they come across\Nthat famous blue meth of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.45,0:18:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure enough, last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.12,0:19:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Got themselves\Nan honest-to-God dealer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.75,0:19:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I was thinking of cruising over\Nand saying hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.79,0:19:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you'd like to go with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.38,0:19:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Well, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.55,0:19:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me to my face\Nyou weren't a cop, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.64,0:19:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel manipulated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.60,0:19:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought we were gonna hang out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.39,0:19:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We are hanging out, Badger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.10,0:19:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You like Badger or Brandon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.27,0:19:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I like people who don' t, like,\Nabuse the Constitution.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.94,0:19:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Badger, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.73,0:19:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.49,0:19:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to help you here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.36,0:19:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if you just tell me\Nwho your supplier is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.91,0:19:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,...l think this can end\Nvery well for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.83,0:19:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What're you doing, detective, talking\Nto my client without me present?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.25,0:19:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You sneaky Pete.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.63,0:19:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is which?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.17,0:19:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What, did the academy hire you\Nright out of the womb?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.80,0:19:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys get younger every--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.80,0:19:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you say to baby face?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.68,0:19:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say anything stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.30,0:20:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,By "anything stupid,"\NI mean anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.51,0:20:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at you.\NMouth open, vocal chords a-twitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.18,0:20:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We' ll talk about it later.\NRight now, you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.73,0:20:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten minutes ago. Go on.\NThere are laws, detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.19,0:20:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Have your kindergarten teacher\Nread them to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.57,0:20:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Go grab a juice box.\NHave a nap. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.87,0:20:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.99,0:20:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do we have?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.45,0:20:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Brandon Mayhew.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.87,0:20:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Brandon Mayhew. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.63,0:20:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Brandon Mayhew.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.71,0:20:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-Here we go. Public masturbation.\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.80,0:20:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it. What's the kick?\NWhy don' t you do it at home...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.89,0:20:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,...with a big flat-screen TV,\N50 channels of pay-per-view?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.72,0:20:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,In a Starbucks. That' s nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.44,0:20:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That ain't me, man. I....
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.56,0:20:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the guy who was selling meth.\NAllegedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.40,0:20:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. All right. l got you.\NMeth. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.61,0:20:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, that was a little\Ntranspositional error.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.95,0:21:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing a little Wite-Out\Ncan' t take care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.78,0:21:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and felony quantity.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.91,0:21:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-Just barely.\N-Yeah, just barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.41,0:21:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The cops are like butchers.\NAlways got their thumbs on the scales.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.67,0:21:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But good luck arguing that in court.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.00,0:21:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me get down to brass tacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.67,0:21:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get you\Na second phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.59,0:21:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You' re gonna call\Nyour mommy or your daddy...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.80,0:21:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,...or your parish priest\Nor your Boy Scout leader...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.39,0:21:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,...and they're gonna\Ndeliver me a check for $4650.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.72,0:21:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna write that down\Non the back of my business card.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.56,0:21:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Four-six-five-zero. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.31,0:21:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And l need that in a cashier's check\Nor a money order, doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.65,0:21:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I want it in a money order.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.32,0:21:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And make it out to\N"Ice Station Zebra Associates."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.28,0:21:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my loan-out. It' s totally legit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.95,0:21:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's done just for tax purposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.20,0:21:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And after that,\Nwe can discuss Visa or MasterCard...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.96,0:21:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,...but definitely not American Express,\Nso don't even ask. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.04,0:21:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.13,0:22:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You' re gonna get me off, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.09,0:22:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I look like, your high-school\Ngirlfriend? Five fingers, no waiting?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.51,0:22:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a joke, Brandon. Lighten up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.31,0:22:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Son, l promise you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.98,0:22:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I will give you\Nthe best criminal defense...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.32,0:22:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,...that money can buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.65,0:22:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but, Francesca,\NI took these already.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.99,0:22:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't l take these already?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.91,0:22:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's on your head. You're not\Nsupposed to double up on vitamin A.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.08,0:22:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's bad for the liver.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.54,0:22:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, who' s next?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.87,0:22:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Did him. l did him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.33,0:22:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That one went public defender.\NThanks for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.80,0:22:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to my masturbator?\NYou got me all turned around.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.42,0:22:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on. l'll get back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.26,0:22:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I sense you' re discussing my client.\NAnything you care to share with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.14,0:22:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure. Your commercials?\NThey suck ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.48,0:22:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen better acting\Nin an epileptic whorehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.31,0:22:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that like the one\Nyour mom works at?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.27,0:22:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she still offering\Nthe two-for-one discount?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.28,0:23:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,DEA, huh? For a street bust.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.36,0:23:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, what would two feds\Nwant with that little twerp?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.59,0:23:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sooner or later,\Nthis was gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.76,0:23:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You want your exponential growth...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.30,0:23:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,...guys are gonna get busted.\NSimple as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.55,0:23:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,How about we get him a real attorney?\NWhat the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.68,0:23:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This is who he hires?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.56,0:23:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Are you kidding me?\NThis is the guy you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.98,0:23:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the guy I'd hire.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.40,0:23:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the guy you' d hire.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.98,0:23:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, you remember Emilio?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.78,0:23:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, this dude got Emilio off,\Nlike, twice. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.86,0:23:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Both times, they had him\Ndead to rights, yo. And then, poof.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.62,0:23:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude is like Houdini.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.99,0:23:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously,\Nwhen the going gets tough...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.00,0:23:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,...you don't want a criminal lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.04,0:23:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You want a "criminal" lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.58,0:24:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Know what l'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.96,0:24:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, we're in good shape,\NMr. White.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.30,0:24:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Badger is way too loyal to roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.76,0:24:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, he's scared shitless of me,\Nall right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.93,0:24:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We pay four large. Cost of business.\NTake it out of his payroll.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.43,0:24:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's only his first dealing rap...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.39,0:24:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...so, worst-case scenario,\Nyou know, they plead him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.19,0:24:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He does five months picking up litter\Nin an orange jump suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.94,0:24:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So who goes inside?\NI don't need them seeing my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.11,0:24:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, l don't need them\Nseeing my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.87,0:24:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?\NYou look like his typical clientele.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.16,0:24:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.83,0:24:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.91,0:24:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We' ll flip for it, all right? Call it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.13,0:24:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.60,0:24:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayhew? Mr. Mayhew?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.41,0:25:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Mayhew.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.99,0:25:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice of you to come down. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.29,0:25:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.83,0:25:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I call the FBl\Nand tell them l found D.B. Cooper?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.00,0:25:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.21,0:25:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I-- Please, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.51,0:25:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.51,0:25:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.72,0:25:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Saul Goodman. Please sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.31,0:25:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's a shame that we have to meet\Nunder these circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.53,0:25:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe you have\Nsomething for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.03,0:25:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.45,0:25:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mayhew. ls that lrish or English?\N-lrish.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.00,0:26:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Faith and begorra.\NA fellow potato-eater.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.04,0:26:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My real name is McGill.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.04,0:26:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The Jew thing\NI just do for the homeboys.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.05,0:26:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They all want a pipe-hitting member\Nof the tribe, so to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.68,0:26:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I digress.\NGood things are happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.76,0:26:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Fact is, your nephew is gonna\Nget out in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.81,0:26:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's wonderful, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.64,0:26:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still a few details\Nto be ironed out...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.23,0:26:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,...but now that the DEA\Nis involved...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.65,0:26:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,...l think he' s looking\Nat time served, then probation.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.32,0:26:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So leave your number with Francesca,\Nand we'll be in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.91,0:26:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-Excuse me, the DEA?\N-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.74,0:26:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the Drug Enforcement\NAdministration. The feds.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.08,0:26:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that I'm not\Nthe breaker of bad news...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.75,0:26:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,...but your nephew got mixed up\Nwith some pretty nasty customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.50,0:26:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.71,0:26:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that have\Nto do with the DEA?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.63,0:26:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They' re after some mystery man...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.34,0:26:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,...some heavy-hitter\Nthat goes by the name Heisenberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.01,0:26:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,They want this guy\Nlike the ax wants the turkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.64,0:26:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems young Brandon\Nmay have information...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.77,0:27:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,...that could lead to his arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.14,0:27:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesus, cheer up.\NThis is good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.35,0:27:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, Brandon fell head-first\Ninto the doo-doo pile...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.11,0:27:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,...and came up\Nsmelling like Paco Rabanne.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.19,0:27:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait. Look, l just.... l think....
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.61,0:27:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I just think that we should\Nreview our options.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.95,0:27:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Options?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.58,0:27:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna tell you\Nwhat your options are.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.79,0:27:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a grand total of two.\NOption A: Brandon takes the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.58,0:27:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Option B:\NBrandon goes up to the penitentiary...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.96,0:27:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,...and gets his rectum\Nresized about yay big.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.80,0:27:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, look. What about reprisals?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.63,0:27:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, if Badger--
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.64,0:27:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If Brandon informs\Non this Heisenberg....
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.60,0:27:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, what if, God forbid...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.48,0:27:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,...that they decide to take revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.48,0:27:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you been telling him?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.48,0:27:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The kid keeps spouting off about,\N"If l talk, they' ll kill me."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.11,0:27:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, he's the only thing\Nholding up this deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.99,0:28:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-Good.\N-No, that's not good. That's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.12,0:28:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, sir, your nephew\Nwon't last in prison two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.42,0:28:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You let him take his chances\Non the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.29,0:28:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can work\Nin some witness protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.46,0:28:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No, look, look.\NThese are vicious, desperate people.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.34,0:28:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been told that\None of them killed another man...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.51,0:28:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...by crushing his head\Nwith an ATM machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.18,0:28:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,People love to take credit\Nfor the fun ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.85,0:28:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy who got his head smooshed\Nused to be a client of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.52,0:28:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,His wife killed him, all right?\NIt was open and shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.32,0:28:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, you folks have\Nnothing to worry about, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.03,0:28:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna set your nephew straight,\Nget him singing like a canary...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.57,0:28:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,...all' s right with the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.08,0:28:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten thousand dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.89,0:29:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten thousand, cash to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.89,0:29:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not saying to throw the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.77,0:29:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Just no talking to the DEA.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.90,0:29:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying\Nwhat I think you' re saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.99,0:29:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.24,0:29:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it going to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.54,0:29:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What, dude wouldn' t take a bribe?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.29,0:29:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That dude in there?\NSaul Goodman we're talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.25,0:29:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. "Morally outraged," he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.13,0:29:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Threatened to call the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.75,0:29:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wait, and Badger is gonna spill?\N-Like the Exxon Valdez.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.76,0:29:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what do we do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.52,0:29:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Francesca,\Nhow about l follow you home?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.77,0:29:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.02,0:29:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,For safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.90,0:29:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.24,0:30:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,God, you are killing me\Nwith that booty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.88,0:30:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk to me. Come on, talk to me, guys.\NI don't know--
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.63,0:30:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, just tell me what you want.\NJesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.51,0:30:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.81,0:30:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it wasn't me.\NIt was Ignacio. He's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.93,0:30:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.56,0:30:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.90,0:30:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, all right?\NJust speak English.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.24,0:30:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Lalo didn't send you? No Lalo?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.66,0:30:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-Who?\N-Oh, thank God! Oh, Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.08,0:30:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, l thought....
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.62,0:30:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What can I do for you, gentlemen?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.00,0:30:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything.\NJust tell me what you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.63,0:31:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This afternoon, an associate of ours\Noffered you $1 0,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.92,0:31:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have taken it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.67,0:31:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.\NThis is in regards to what's-his-name?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.97,0:31:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Badger! Brandon Mayhew.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.76,0:31:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The uncle. That was your guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.31,0:31:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No offense, but l don't take bribes\Nfrom strangers, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.27,0:31:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Better safe than sorry.\NThat's my motto.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.81,0:31:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-But l'll take your money! Sure!\N-No, that offer has expired, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.44,0:31:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It was kind of low anyways.\NBut okay, okay, l' ll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.57,0:31:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just tell me what you need,\Nall right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.49,0:31:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm easy. I'm gonna keep\Na happy thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.79,0:31:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,...and assume\Nthis is just a negotiating tactic.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.29,0:31:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, listen to me very carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.54,0:31:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You are going to give\NBadger Mayhew...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.63,0:31:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,...the best legal representation ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.96,0:31:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But no deals with the DEA.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.42,0:31:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,All right? Badger will not identify\Nanyone to anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.30,0:31:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If he does, you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.89,0:31:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don' t you just kill Badger?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.27,0:32:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, follow me, but\Nif a mosquito is buzzing around you...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.27,0:32:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,...and it bites you on the ass,\Nyou don't go gunning for the attorney.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.70,0:32:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You go grab a fly swatter.\NI mean, so to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.53,0:32:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, all due respect,\Nbut do I have to spell this out for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.29,0:32:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-We're not killing Badger, yo.\N-Then you got real problems, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.54,0:32:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Because the DEA\Nwill come down on your boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.75,0:32:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,...like a proverbial ton of bricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.88,0:32:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think\NI'm going out on a limb here...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.17,0:32:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,...but, hey,\Nhe's not gonna like prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.17,0:32:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna sing like Celine Dion\Nregardless of what you do to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.27,0:32:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Mayhew?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.27,0:32:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Recognize your cough. Take that\Nmask off, you know. Get some air.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.27,0:32:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.95,0:32:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-God.\N-Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.78,0:32:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Breathe in, breathe out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.62,0:32:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. l'm gonna stand up, all right?\NBecause I got bad knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.25,0:33:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.84,0:33:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, now listen. The three of us\Nare gonna work this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.63,0:33:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.38,0:33:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,First thing, you'll put a dollar\Nin my pocket, both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.93,0:33:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You want attorney-client privilege,\Ndon't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.31,0:33:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So that everything you say\Nis strictly between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.60,0:33:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean it. Put a dollar in my pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.65,0:33:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, make it official.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.28,0:33:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.28,0:33:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it, come on. Just a dollar.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.29,0:33:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, now you, ski bum.\NCome on. Give with the dollar.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.62,0:33:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-Go on.\N-Be smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.87,0:33:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.00,0:33:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-All l got is a five.\N-l'll take a five.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.01,0:33:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, already.\NCome on. Be cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.93,0:33:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you're now both\Nofficially represented...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.22,0:33:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,...by Saul Goodman and Associates.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.02,0:34:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Your secrets are safe with me\Nunder threat of disbarment.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.81,0:34:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the ski mask off. Feel like I' m\Ntalking to the Weather Underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.03,0:34:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.62,0:34:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, so if a prison shanking\Nis completely off the table....
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.20,0:34:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And we' re sure of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.08,0:34:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No shanking!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.59,0:34:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.71,0:34:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The way l see it is\Nsomebody is going to prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.05,0:34:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a matter of who.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.39,0:34:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Lame-ass TV ads aside...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.85,0:34:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,...your lawyer here,\Nhe cooked you up a pretty killer deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.57,0:34:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Time served, no probation.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.02,0:34:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pretty slick.\NCouldn' t believe the judge went for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.28,0:34:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get cocky.\NYou ain't home free yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.87,0:34:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't give us\Nthe name of your supplier...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.12,0:35:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-...you' re going nowhere.\N-The tough guy act is unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.54,0:35:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This young man\Nis cooperating fully.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.04,0:35:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that right?\NYeah, you cooperating?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.92,0:35:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's start with a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.26,0:35:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He just goes by Heisenberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.93,0:35:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Heisenberg, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.27,0:35:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How old is this Heisenberg?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.43,0:35:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Old. Like 50 or 70 or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.44,0:35:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-Height?\N-Average, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.77,0:35:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Medium height, medium weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.86,0:35:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-What color hair?\N-No hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.07,0:35:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude is balder than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.91,0:35:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,1 963, James Edward Kilkelly...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.58,0:35:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,...is convicted of stealing\Na vending machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.29,0:35:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,1 975, breaking and entering.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.29,0:35:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,1 982, grand theft auto.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.13,0:35:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,1 984, armed robbery.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.67,0:35:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,1 987, 1 992. You get the idea.\NAnd here he is today.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.22,0:35:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Better known as Jimmy ln-and-Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.30,0:36:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,City, State, and Federal, he's spent\N44 of the last 58 years inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.81,0:36:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Entire life behind bars.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.77,0:36:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Jimmy provides\Na very special service.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.23,0:36:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,For a price,\NJimmy will go to prison for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.07,0:36:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,On purpose?\NThe guy goes to prison on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.70,0:36:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He's actually\Nmore comfortable inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.83,0:36:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The outside world\Nhasn't been too kind to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.29,0:36:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometime during\Nthe Clinton administration...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.50,0:36:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,...Jimmy figured out how he could\Nuse his talents to turn a profit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.13,0:36:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-So when does all this happen?\N-lt's already happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.14,0:36:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The buy is set for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.64,0:36:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cops bust Jimmy, Badger gets out,\Neverybody's happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.52,0:36:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,...and all it' s gonna cost you\Nis 80 thousand and one pound...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.73,0:36:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,...of your finest meth.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.86,0:36:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Eighty thousand dollars\Nfor eight years of his life, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.91,0:37:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,First of all,\Nhe's not gonna do eight years.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.32,0:37:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll represent him, and l guarantee...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.33,0:37:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,...there'll be some unexpected\Nproblems with the prosecution' s case.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.04,0:37:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Secondly, he gets 30.\NFifty goes to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.87,0:37:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-You get 50? For what?\N-For facilitating.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.13,0:37:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's taking a bigger risk here?\NHe likes prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.01,0:37:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You did bring the cash, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.22,0:37:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, if this option\Nis too expensive...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.51,0:37:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,...you can still always...Badger\Nin the chow line.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.24,0:37:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Conscience gets expensive,\Ndoesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.76,0:38:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. There's our boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.43,0:38:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Right on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.41,0:38:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-Go back.\N-What? All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.30,0:38:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what do you think?\NThey see us?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.35,0:38:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No, man, I think we're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.64,0:38:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Badger looks like\Nhe's gonna throw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.15,0:38:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me those back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.82,0:38:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give them to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.44,0:39:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.82,0:39:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell is Jimmy?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.24,0:39:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Should've been here\N1 0 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.45,0:39:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You think Jimmy is actually for real?\NA guy who wants to be in prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.75,0:39:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There's more\Nthan one kind of prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.96,0:39:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell\Nis that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.00,0:39:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is-- Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.67,0:39:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, no, no, no.\N-What? What? Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.76,0:39:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-Who the hell is that?\N-l don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.68,0:39:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Heisenberg, I presume.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.68,0:39:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to move?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.64,0:39:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see the exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.52,0:39:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no. Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.74,0:39:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-What?\N-Now he shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.33,0:39:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.42,0:39:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.96,0:39:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.\NJimmy is on the wrong bench. Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.71,0:40:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We are screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.01,0:40:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.59,0:40:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.80,0:40:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it. What's the holdup?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.40,0:40:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the stuff, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.90,0:40:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-Where are we going?\N-Just shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.91,0:40:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out. Go stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.33,0:40:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The DEA is right there.\NIf they see me, we're screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.96,0:40:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out. l'll do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.67,0:40:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-What?\N-Just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.60,0:40:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hank, l thought that was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.93,0:40:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Schrader, I'm blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.73,0:40:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Walt, not a good time.\N-How you doing? You feeling okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.69,0:41:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Schrader, I'm blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.40,0:41:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We' re working.\NYou gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.61,0:41:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-Working? Oh, like DEA working?\N-Schrader, we' re missing it. Schrader.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.15,0:41:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something going down?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.45,0:41:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong guy, wrong guy.\NOther bench.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.79,0:41:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt, Walt.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.13,0:41:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-Walter, move your ass now.\N-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.46,0:41:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, l'll just go, leave you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.46,0:41:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-We'll talk about it later. Just floor it.\N-Should l back up?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.47,0:41:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-Go that way.\N-Forward is better?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.09,0:41:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be out of the way there.\NOkay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.14,0:41:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, all right? l'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.81,0:41:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-l'll leave you alone.\N-We'll talk later. Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.14,0:41:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?\NWhere the hell did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.98,0:41:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait. Wait, wait, wait. Got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.49,0:41:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-Looks like it' s going down.\N-Take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.88,0:42:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Freeze! Hey, right there.\NDon't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.30,0:42:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, get him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.52,0:42:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.19,0:42:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I think they bought it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.78,0:42:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.03,0:42:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Textbook bust, sir. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.62,0:42:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we got a full pound\Nof the blue stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.37,0:42:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and Heisenberg's real name?\NJames Kilkelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.42,0:42:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Thank you very much.\NIt was my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.24,0:43:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.57,0:43:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You weren't home,\Nso l let the delivery guys in.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.29,0:43:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-l hope that' s okay.\N-Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.09,0:43:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So you bought a bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.72,0:43:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.43,0:43:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that, a king?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.64,0:43:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Pillow top?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.43,0:44:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.\NYou really are a chemistry teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.31,0:44:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.90,0:44:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I was terrible at chemistry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.32,0:44:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm more of a humanities guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.16,0:44:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-How did you find me?\N-We should talk about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.95,0:44:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It should be much, much harder\Nfor people to track you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.50,0:44:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,My PI charged me for three hours...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.33,0:44:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,...so l seriously doubt\Nit took him more than one.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.21,0:44:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is what, blackmail?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.55,0:44:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Walter, l' m your lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.47,0:45:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything you say to me\Nis totally privileged.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.10,0:45:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not in the shake down racket.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.85,0:45:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a lawyer. Even drug dealers\Nneed lawyers, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.48,0:45:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially drug dealers.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.02,0:45:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what, you' re just doing this\Nout of the kindness of your heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.61,0:45:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.\NHave you seen my hourly rate?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.20,0:45:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,\Nwhere do you keep the money?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.37,0:45:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it in your mattress? Is it in a jelly jar\Nburied in the side yard?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.87,0:45:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This kid Mayhew may be the first\Nof your guys to get picked up...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.04,0:45:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,...but he won't be the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.54,0:45:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And if l can find you,\Nhow far behind can the cops be?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.30,0:45:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.93,0:45:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly are you\Noffering to do for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.30,0:45:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What did Tom Hagen\Ndo for Vito Corleone?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.77,0:45:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no Vito Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.06,0:45:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No shit. Right now, you're Fredo.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.02,0:45:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But with some sound advice...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.73,0:45:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,...and the proper introductions,\Nwho knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.32,0:45:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you,\Nyou' ve got the right product.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.49,0:46:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything that gets the DEA's panties\Nin this big a bunch...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.45,0:46:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,...you're on to something special.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.33,0:46:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And l would like to be\Na small and silent part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.29,0:46:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Food for thought, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.55,0:46:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you wanna make more money\Nand keep the money that you make...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.51,0:46:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,..."Better call Saul!"
